spec/*
# Pack fixtures (code-quality/security/devops) are product source, not
# local backlog state — un-ignore them so CI can run PackIntegrationTests
# (the rest of spec/ stays local-only). See process-gap-loop-verifies-on-
# lenient-local-toolchain-vs-ci-2026-06-07.
!spec/packs/
charter.md
.claude/settings.json
*.xcuserstate
*.profraw
.swiftpm/xcode/xcuserdata/

# macOS Finder duplicates — `Foo 2.swift`/`Foo 2/` are produced when a
# file or folder is duplicated in Finder; same-module redeclarations
# break `swift build` with ambiguous-symbol errors. Ignored so a Finder
# slip can't blow up the build silently again. (Resolved en masse on
# 2026-05-04 via the workspace-hygiene round; see
# spec/autonomous/backlog/workspace-hygiene-finder-duplicate-source-files-2026-05-04.md.)
* 2.swift
* 2.md
* 2.sh
* 2.py
* 2/

# Cowork-generated debugging artifacts at the repo root. Convention:
# leading underscore + script-type extension signals "operator/Cowork-
# driven, ephemeral" (build/test discriminators, onboarding-pass
# captures, screencap commands, staged .app bundles). Anchored at root
# with leading `/` so a deeper `Sources/Foo/_internal.swift`-style file
# is not accidentally matched.
/_*.command
/_*.log
/_*.stderr
/_*.stdout
/_*-SenkaniApp.app/
